    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitali, hinukumona Kana kamukoku nemani hampidi yaZiyona, wudi nankulakaji yamakombakaji namakombakaji makumi awana nawana, fakweti ijina dindi niijina daTata yindi akusoneka liamahamawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutiya izu kwiwulu, didi neyi kuvuma kwameji amavulu, didi neyi kuvuma kwachivumina chasweja. Izu odu dinatiyili dadiŋi neyi dawakwakwimba tudada twawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakwimbila kaimina kakaha kumesu etanda ni kumesu awamomi awana niawawakulumpi. Hi kwadiŋi muntu watwesheli kudiza kaminokuku, chiŋa wowu nkulakaji yamakombakaji namakombakaji makumi awana nawana anakúuluwu mudi antu ahamaseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diwu abulili kudijilola nawambanda, muloŋa hiyajiki. Diwu alondaŋa Kana kamukoku kwayaloŋayi kwejima. Diwu akúuliluwu mukachi kawantu ekali nyikabu yaNzambi niyaKana kamukoku yatachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukanwa kawu himwadiŋi makasuku, hiyakweti hataminawuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumona kaŋelu mukwawu hakutúuka hakachi kaluzwizu, nasendi Nsaŋu yayiwahi yahaya nyaka, ashimuni kudi antu ejima ashakama heseki, ninyuza yejima, ninyichidi yejima, niakwamadimi ejima, niamumatuŋa ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila nezu datiyakana nindi, Akamenu Nzambi mumulemeshi; muloŋa mpinji yakusompeshayi yinashi ki dehi; difukulenu kudi waleŋeh niiwulu nimaseki nikaluŋalwiji nituseloki twameji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himukulondela kaŋelu mukwawu, wamuchiyedi, nindi, Babiloni muneni nahumoki, nahumoki! Owu wanwishilaŋa nyuza yejima vinya yandombu yawuvumbi windi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himukulondela nikaŋelu mukwawu, wamuchisatu, hakwila nezu datiyakana nindi, Muntu wukudifukula kudi owu kanyama nikumukishi windi, hakwiteja kumufunda hehama dindi hela hachikasa chindi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yena nawa wakanwa vinyu yandombu yaNzambi yemawu delii, yanahuŋununuwu mulupasa lwakuzuwa kwindi chakadi kufumpula. Akamumwesha yihuŋu nakesi ni kesi kaNzambi, iku aŋelu ajila adi nakutala, niKana kamukoku wudi nakutala nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wishi wayihuŋu yawu hiwukukakumuka haya nyaka nanyaka. Awa akadifukula kudi owu kanyama nikumukishi windi nakutambula mufunda wejina dindi, hiyakamona kunooka hela mwaana hela wufukuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweniku diku kudi kutatakena kwawakwakujila, ahembaŋa mwayilejaŋawu kudi Nzambi nikukuhwelela kwamukuhwelelawu Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutiya izu kwiwulu nindi, Sonekaku neyi, Kufumisha kulelu afu akufwa mudi Mwanta anakooleki. Spiritu nindi, Mwamweni, kulonda akanooki; kukabakana kwawu kunamani dehi, nyidimu yawu yakayilondela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami nitali, hinukumona ivu ditooka. Hevu odu hashakama wiunu wudi neyi mwana kamuntu; kunamutu windi kudi chibaaba chawuru, kuchikasa chindi kudi chikwakwa chatwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu mukwawu hakwidika mutembeli nakubidika nezu datiyakana; hakubidika owu washakama hevu nindi, Shaku chikwakwa cheyi wumuni; muloŋa mpinji yakumuna yinashi ki dehi; muloŋa yuma yaheseki yakumunawu yasweja dehi kuha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wáshakama hevu hakuzwiyazwiya chikwakwa chindi heseki; amuna niiseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
